Stable paths in the system prompt's context-file markers

The '--- Context from: <path> ---' markers used path.relative(cwd, file), so a
file under the home directory read '../../../../.qwen/...' and the system
prompt differed per working directory, defeating provider prompt caching for
everything after it. The markers now use the same display form as the
announced context-file list: relative inside the CWD, '~/...' under home.

